title: The Linke Threatens to Leave
subtitle: We have angered the Linke too much.
new-page: true
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and in_left_front = 1 and linke_coalition_dissent >= 4
tags: event
go-to: menu

= The Linke Threatens to Leave

The Linke has had enough of our compromises. Its leadership says that it will leave the government unless something changes.

@menu

- @try_assuage: Try to calm them down.
- @new_partners: Look for new partners in the centre.
- @let_it_happen: Let them go.

@try_assuage

How do we calm the Linke down?

- @resources: Use our resources to smooth things over.
- @menu: Never mind.

@resources
choose-if: resources >= 3 and linke_review_seen = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < 3 : We do not have enough resources. ?][? if linke_review_seen : Resources can no longer fix this. ?]
subtitle: -3 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 3; linke_coalition_dissent -= 1

We promise them a few laws and a few posts. It is a crude solution, but it works for now.

@new_partners
choose-if: (kenya_coalition >= 50 and cdu_relation >= 40 and greens_relation >= 40) or (grand_coalition >= 50 and cdu_relation >= 45) or (traffic_light_coalition >= 50 and fdp_relation >= 35 and greens_relation >= 40)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if grand_coalition < 50 and kenya_coalition < 50 and traffic_light_coalition < 50 : No other coalition would have a majority. ?][? if cdu_relation < 45 : After governing with the Linke, the CDU/CSU does not trust us. ?]

We could drop the Linke and look for partners in the centre.

- @election_1928.grand_coalition: Form a coalition with the CDU/CSU.
- @election_1928.kenya_coalition: Form a Kenya coalition.
- @election_1928.traffic_light_coalition: Form a traffic-light coalition.
- @let_it_happen: There is nothing we can do.

@let_it_happen
on-arrival: linke_relation -= 8; workers_linke -= 3; workers_spd -= 4; unemployed_spd -= 3; linke_coalition_dissent = 0; trust_in_democracy -= 3
go-to: rot_gruen_left if coalition = "r2g"; spd_alone_left if coalition != "r2g"

@rot_gruen_left
on-arrival: coalition = "rot_gruen"
call: apply_government

The Linke leaves the cabinet. Chancellor [+ chancellor +] carries on with a red-green minority government, which will need votes from the opposition for every law.

@spd_alone_left
on-arrival: coalition = "spd_minority"
call: apply_government

The Linke leaves the cabinet. Chancellor [+ chancellor +] carries on with an SPD minority government, which will need votes from the opposition for every law.
